1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,200
The nature of the mind is such that it is always seeking something.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,400
If you attend to this one moment, everything else will fall into place.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Your body and your mind are not you. They are things that you have gathered.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,400
The more aware you become, the less you suffer.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Do not try to become peaceful. See how you are creating your own turmoil.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
This is not a philosophy. This is a science of inner wellbeing.
